1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,677
Mercury dissolves most metals to form amalgams, like sodium amalgam and dental amalgam, but not iron or platinum, so it is transported in iron bottles.

2
00:00:10,677 --> 00:00:18,385
A spill is dusted with sulphur, which forms solid, non volatile mercury sulphide that can be swept up safely.

